#
### Commi™ Generic .gitignore v1.3.1
#
#
## AI Personal Settings & Byproducts
# Scratch files an agent writes while working: scripts, notes, intermediate output
/.claude-tmp/
# Junction to .claude2/, recreated by .claude2/link.ps1; no trailing slash, git may see a junction as a link
.claude/agents
.claude/settings.local.json
# Junction to .claude2/, recreated by .claude2/link.ps1; no trailing slash, git may see a junction as a link
.claude/skills
.playwright-mcp/
CLAUDE.local.md
#
#
## Development Byproducts
.env
**/logs/*
nocommit.properties
**/nocommit/*
PERSONAL.md
#
#
## Expo Byproducts
.expo/
# Native project, generated by `expo prebuild` from app.json
android/
# Output of `expo export`
dist/
# Native project, generated by `expo prebuild` from app.json
ios/
#
#
## GPG Byproducts
*.sign
*.unknown
#
#
## Gradle Byproducts
.gradle/
#
#
## IntelliJ IDEA Byproducts
*.iml
.idea/*
!.idea/runConfigurations/
#
#
## Java Byproducts
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
#
#
## Maven Byproducts
target/
#
#
## NPM Byproducts
node_modules
#
#
## Python Byproducts
*.pyc
.venv/
__pycache__/
#
#
## Vite Byproducts
# Local env files, .env.local and .env.[mode].local
*.local
# Output of `vite build`
dist/
#
#
## Webpack Byproducts
build/
!**/src/**/build/
#
